<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1988</h1><p class="ref-lede">1988 in world history: 23 events, 1 birth, 9 deaths and 1 state founded. 255 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
