<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-chile"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Chile.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Chile</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Voters reject Pinochet in a plebiscite</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/myanmar"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Myanmar.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Myanmar</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A nationwide uprising is crushed and a new military junta takes power</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-somaliland"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Somaliland.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Somaliland</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Government forces bombard Hargeisa and Burao in the war with the SNM</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/velvet-revolution"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Velvet%20Revolution.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Velvet Revolution</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The first anti-government demonstrations, among them the Candle Demonstration, are dispersed by the police</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/mahabharata"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Mahabharata.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Mahabharata</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">B. R. Chopra's television series Mahabharat is broadcast on India's national television, Doordarshan</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/armenian-ssr"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Armenian%20SSR.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Armenian SSR</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Supreme Soviet of the Nagorno-Karabakh Autonomous Oblast votes on 20 February to unite with Armenia, starting the Karabakh movement; a devastating earthquake strikes the republic</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/city/djenne"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Djenn%C3%A9.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Djenné</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">UNESCO names Djenné and Djenné-Djeno a World Heritage Site</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/great-mosque-of-djenne"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Great%20Mosque%20of%20Djenn%C3%A9.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Great Mosque of Djenné</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The historic areas of Djenné, including the Great Mosque, were designated a World Heritage Site by UNESCO</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/hawaiian-religion"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Hawaiian%20religion.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Hawaiian religion</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The unearthing of 1,000 graves during construction of a hotel on Maui leads to its redesign and relocation inland</span></li></ul></section>
